WEBVTT

00:00:05.877 --> 00:00:14.480
<v><b>Alicia:</b></v> Hello, I’m Alicia. Today I’m in Brighton. Brighton is in the south of England.

00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:31.963
It’s on the coast. It’s a fantastic town, and it’s famous for the Royal Pavilion, the pier, and the beach.

00:00:33.831 --> 00:00:38.987
But I’m not on holiday. I’m here to visit an English language school.

00:00:40.747 --> 00:00:48.934
This is the school. It’s a big school with about three hundred and fifty students.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:57.803
Rike and Woo are students at the school. Hyeongwoo is twenty-three years old.

00:00:58.015 --> 00:01:06.760
He’s from Korea. He’s a beginner student. His class is small, with only five students.

00:01:08.359 --> 00:01:14.972
His teacher is Stephen. He’s English. He’s very friendly, and he’s a very good teacher.

00:01:17.733 --> 00:01:21.586
Rike is nineteen years old. She’s from Germany.

00:01:23.195 --> 00:01:30.817
She’s an intermediate student, and her class is big, with eleven students. Her teacher is Laura.

00:01:31.097 --> 00:01:35.920
She’s English. She’s really nice, and she’s a very good teacher, too.

00:01:37.367 --> 00:01:46.155
When Rike and Woo aren’t in class, they’re in the computer room…or here, in the canteen.

00:01:46.675 --> 00:01:53.857
In the evening they’re at home. Rike and Woo live in a student house. It’s near the school.

00:01:54.697 --> 00:02:06.105
It’s a big house with five bedrooms, a kitchen, and a garden.

00:02:08.868 --> 00:02:11.949
Brighton is great for students like Rike and Hyeongwoo.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:15.529
The people are friendly, and the town is exciting and fun!